<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8fafc">
  <title>Rate Limiter API</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
        sans-serif;
      color: #172033;
      background: #f8fafc;
      font-synthesis: none;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .header {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #eff6ff;
      color: #1d4ed8;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .section-title {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 19px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .endpoint-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .endpoint {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgb(15 23 42 / 3%);
    }

    .endpoint-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .method {
      display: inline-block;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .method.get {
      background: #dbeafe;
      color: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .category {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .path {
      display: block;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .description {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }

    .info-card {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .info-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .limit-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .limit-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .limit-name {
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .limit-value {
      text-align: right;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .header-code {
      display: inline-block;
      max-width: 100%;
      padding: 7px 9px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .note {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      body {
        padding: 28px 15px;
      }

      .endpoint-list,
      .info-grid {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .endpoint,
      .info-card {
        padding: 17px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="container">
    <header class="header">
      <span class="eyebrow">API Reference</span>
      <h1>Rate Limiter API</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        A Node.js and Express API demonstrating custom, in-memory rate
        limiting based on user tier and endpoint category.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="endpoints-heading">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="endpoints-heading">
        Available endpoints
      </h2>

      <div class="endpoint-list">
        <article class="endpoint">
          <div class="endpoint-top">
            <span class="method">POST</span>
            <span class="category">AI category</span>
          </div>
          <code class="path">/api/ai/generate</code>
          <p class="description">
            Generate AI content. Subject to the AI request limit for the
            selected user tier.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="endpoint">
          <div class="endpoint-top">
            <span class="method">POST</span>
            <span class="category">AI category</span>
          </div>
          <code class="path">/api/ai/summarise</code>
          <p class="description">
            Summarise content. Subject to the AI request limit for the
            selected user tier.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="endpoint">
          <div class="endpoint-top">
            <span class="method get">GET</span>
            <span class="category">Read category</span>
          </div>
          <code class="path">/api/data/list</code>
          <p class="description">
            Retrieve the available data list.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="endpoint">
          <div class="endpoint-top">
            <span class="method get">GET</span>
            <span class="category">Read category</span>
          </div>
          <code class="path">/api/data/export</code>
          <p class="description">
            Access the data export endpoint.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-grid" aria-label="API configuration">
      <article class="info-card">
        <h2>Rate limits</h2>

        <div class="limit-row">
          <span class="limit-name">Free · AI</span>
          <span class="limit-value">5 requests / min</span>
        </div>

        <div class="limit-row">
          <span class="limit-name">Free · Read</span>
          <span class="limit-value">30 requests / min</span>
        </div>

        <div class="limit-row">
          <span class="limit-name">Paid · AI</span>
          <span class="limit-value">30 requests / min</span>
        </div>

        <div class="limit-row">
          <span class="limit-name">Paid · Read</span>
          <span class="limit-value">120 requests / min</span>
        </div>

        <p class="note">
          Exceeding a limit returns HTTP 429 until the current 60-second
          window expires.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="info-card">
        <h2>Request headers</h2>

        <p class="note">Choose the user tier with this header:</p>
        <p><code class="header-code">X-User-Tier: free</code></p>
        <p><code class="header-code">X-User-Tier: paid</code></p>

        <p class="note">
          Missing or invalid tier values default to the free tier.
        </p>
        <p class="note">
          Allowed requests return a JSON response:
          <code class="header-code">{"ok":true}</code>
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <footer>
      Rate Limiter API · Node.js · Express
      <br>
      Rate-limit state is stored in memory and resets when the server restarts.
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>